# Lanes' bulk output (briefs/EVOLUTION-COMMON.md "Disk is the memory": it never travels in a landing). Lane A236, 15 Nov.
# Files already tracked there stay tracked (docs link some of them); a new file a doc must link is added with `git add -f`.
# No test reads under these folders (searched: *.test.mjs and Game/Source tests); tools' pinned inputs live beside out/, not in it.
tools/**/out/
tools/**/raw/
tools/**/*.pid
# Crash dumps of Git Bash tools (bash.exe.stackdump, du.exe.stackdump at the root)
*.stackdump
